196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 174 0 R
/E (Nuclei is a fast, open-source, template-based vulnerability scanner developed by ProjectDiscovery. Unlike traditional scanners that rely on compiled binaries and vendor-defined checks, Nuclei uses community-contributed YAML templates to define exactly how each vulnerability is detected. This approach enables rapid response to newly disclosed CVEs and allows security teams to customize detection logic for their specific environments.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 174 0 R
/E (The scanner can simultaneously assess web applications, network services, DNS configurations, SSL/TLS certificates, and APIs in a single automated run. With over 9,900 templates covering CVEs, misconfigurations, exposed administrative panels, and weak security configurations, Nuclei provides comprehensive coverage without requiring expensive licenses or proprietary software.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
